reland-2026-10-21-upstream: which of the 101 repositories land CLEAN with only published tools?

Converter: babelfont upstream main 5ff5bf04 (simoncozens/babelfont-rs, published). Builder:
land.py's default (gftools-rust 1e638bd). Landed into scratch (OUT, LANDED, SCRATCH set), so
sfd-reland-repos/ and landed.tsv were untouched.

  BF_TREE=<5ff5bf04 worktree> sh tools/build_babelfont.sh
  BF_TREE=<5ff5bf04 worktree> OUT=<scratch>/repos LANDED=<scratch>/landed.tsv \
    SCRATCH=<scratch>/land sh tools/reland_all.sh 2026-10-21-upstream

